usage: module-nav permissions [-h] [--module PERM_MODULE] [-n N] [--declared]
                              [--type {station,all,workbench}] [--summary]

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --module, -m PERM_MODULE
                        Filter to a specific module
  -n N                  Max results to show (default 200)
  --declared            Scan META-INF/module.xml <permissions> blocks instead of callsites
  --type {station,all,workbench}
                        Restrict --declared results to one permission type
  --summary             With --declared: show aggregate counts (per module/type/class) instead of
                        rows
